WEBVTT

00:08:28.331 --> 00:08:30.688
Oh, Lord.

00:08:30.712 --> 00:08:36.509
Something must change.

00:08:38.762 --> 00:08:43.371
AYGTK: Something must change.

00:08:44.397 --> 00:08:47.633
"At Buffalo" reveals
how the United States today

00:08:47.657 --> 00:08:51.197
stands at similar crossroads
as 1901 America.

00:08:51.617 --> 00:08:55.172
Just as the name of Sam Hose
filled newspapers back then,

00:08:55.196 --> 00:08:57.834
today's media carries the names of:

00:08:57.858 --> 00:08:59.521
JMR: Oscar Grant.